hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-40 : List (List Word)
hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-40 = cons "This closes the loop current systems leave open. A knowledge graph should know what its knowledge is for, which" (cons "questions it was assembled to answer, and which conclusions are still missing. In hyperactivity, purposes are" (cons "nodes, evidence is objects, and the paths from evidence to purpose are constructions. Organizing a body of" (cons "knowledge work and what it rests on needs no new primitive: the workflow, documents by content" (cons "and projections of one value already were the system." (cons "" nil)))))
